❄❄❄Hello to the community of the Blockade game.❄❄❄

Dear Players! On behalf of the project Administration and the Developers team, we would like to congratulate you on the upcoming holidays! In the New Year, we wish you only the best and brightest. We wish that your cherished dreams come true and your goals are achieved! Good health to you! Let the outgoing year leave all the bad and unpleasant with it. Let all the problems and worries remain in the past year!

As you all know, every year around this time the hottest update of the year comes out! Here you have snow on the maps and thematic music with Easter eggs, and more :) We would like to warn you right away that this is the first part of the update. There will be another small update in the coming days, since we did not have time to do everything for the release.

Details on this update await you below.

Innovations:
[list]
[*] All players received gifts: 50 coins, 100 "SKULLS", 25 M61 grenades, 2 days of PREMIUM, 25 MK3 grenades, 25 M202, 25 L first aid kits, 25 mortars, 25 mines;
[*] A festive themed event has started in the game, in which you can get a "HOLIDAY" badge as a reward and a choice of weapons (BROWNING HI-POWER, AEK919K, GALIL AR, АВС-36, PANZER BP-12, BT APC, HK MG4, FIRE AXE, KITCHEN KNIFE from the new "HOLIDAY" edition), masks (ANIME, SNAKE), hats (WARM BLUE HAT, BLUE HAT WITH EARFLAPS, CONE), badges (BEAR, SNOWMAN, OWL, ANIME GIRL) and skins (SUPERPLAYER, LOLLIPOP). You have the opportunity to farm the event currency "SKULLS", for which you can buy rare or unique items of your choice not only from this year's event, but also old themed or unique items. The event is divided into 2 parts. To complete the entire event, you need to make purchases in the event store for the event currency "SKULLS". It is not necessary to buy all the items. To complete the first part, you need to buy 10 of 12 items, and to complete the second part, 15 of 18. When completing each of the parts, you will receive unique skins SUPERPLAYER and CARAMEL as a reward. The second part of the event will be available after December 31. All "SKULLS" will disappear after the event, but do not worry. After completing the event, you will have access to the "ANTIQUE SHOP", so you will have a place to spend the "SKULLS". The event currency is farmed by completing quests or killing players and zombies on the servers. The event will last until January 26 (23.59.59 Moscow time);
[*] The "ANTIQUE SHOP" event store has been replenished with an assortment of themed goods, as well as new unique goods. You can only buy items in this store for "SHELLS";
[*] New themed skins have been added to the game: SUPERPLAYER, CARAMEL;
[*] The following weapons from the "HOLIDAY" edition have been added to the game: BROWNING HI-POWER, AEK919K, GALIL AR, АВС-36, PANZER BP-12, BT APC, HK MG4, FIRE AXE, KITCHEN KNIFE;
[*] All weapons of the HOLIDAY edition do not differ in characteristics from fully pumped basic analogs;
[*] Some weapons of the HOLIDAY edition have their own set of modules;
[*] The HOLIDAY edition can be purchased for "SHARDS" in 1 year;
[*] The assortment of the "ANTIQUE SHOP" has been expanded with new unique items that cannot be purchased for other currencies: MP-155 ULTIMA, AK ALFA, the "URBAN BLUE" edition;
[*] The following weapons of the "URBAN BLUE" edition have been added to the game: CZ 75, PPS-43, PP-91 KEDR, TAR-21, AK ALFA, RPD, STEYR SCOUT, REMINGTON 870, MP-155 ULTIMA;
[*] All weapons of the "URBAN BLUE" edition have similar characteristics to their basic analogs;
[*] The weapons of the URBAN BLUE edition can be upgraded;
[*] Some weapons of the URBAN BLUE edition have their own set of modules;
[*] The URBAN BLUE edition can only be purchased for "SHARDS";
[*] The "ICE" edition has been expanded with new items: LUGER P08, TMP, FMG-9, AUG A3, SG552, FLAMETHROW, CROSSBOW, KEL-TEC KSG, KNIFE;
[*] All weapons of the "ICE" edition do not differ in characteristics from fully upgraded basic analogues;
[*] Some weapons of the "ICE" edition have their own set of modules;
[*] The "ICE" edition can be purchased for "SHARDS";
[*] New masks have been added to the game: ANIME, SNAKE, NEON BLUE, NEON RED, NEON GREEN, NEON YELLOW, NEON PINK, NEON PURPLE;
[*] These masks can only be purchased for "SHARDS": NEON BLUE, NEON RED, NEON GREEN, NEON YELLOW, NEON PINK, NEON PURPLE;
[*] The following hats have been added to the game: WARM BLUE HAT, BLUE HAT WITH EAR FLAP, CONE, BLUE HAT-GAS MASK, BLUE HAT OF SANTA CLAUS, ANGELIC HALO;
[*] These hats can be purchased for "SHARDS": BLUE HAT-GAS MASK, BLUE HAT OF SANTA CLAUS, ANGELIC HALO;
[*] Thematic icons have been added to the game: BEAR, SNOWMAN, ANIME GIRL, OWL;
[*] All new items from the event will be available for purchase in 1 year;
[*] During the event, the SNOWBALLS and INVASION modes have been launched;
[*] The following weapons have been added to sale: SPECTRE M4, VITYAZ-SN;
[*] Old themed items from previous years have been added to sale;
[*] Themed skins can be purchased in the ANTIQUE SHOP: ZORRO, DRAGON;
[*] The following skins have been added to sale for SKULLS: ALP, ALPINA;
[*] The following masks can be purchased in the ANTIQUE SHOP: LADYBUG, RED NOSE, BULL, DRAGON, GLASSES WITH HORNS;
[*] The following hats can be purchased in the ANTIQUE SHOP: SNOWMAN, GAS MASK HAT, BEAR, RUDOLF, TV;
[*] In the "ANTIQUE SHOP" you can buy thematic icons: BOW, BELLS;
[*] The following weapons have been added to the game: BT APC, PANZER BP-12, HK MG4. New weapons will be available for purchase in 1 year for coins;
[*] Added Easter Eggs-Animals and classic Easter Eggs of two types. Easter eggs will be in the game until January 7 (23.59.59 Moscow time). It is useless to look for them on private servers!
[/list]

The chance of Easter eggs appearing depends on the number of players on the server (the key values ​​are 5, 8, 10, 12 players on the server). The minimum chance of appearing is with 5 players. The maximum chance of appearing is with 12 players or more;

The chance of animal Easter eggs appearing is from 4% (with 5 players on the server) to 20% (with 12 or more players on the server);

The chance of large Easter eggs appearing is from 4% (with 5 players on the server) to 20% (with 12 or more players on the server);

The chance of small Easter eggs appearing is from 10% (with 5 players on the server) to 50% (with 12 or more players on the server);

The mechanics of Animal Easter eggs - one of the players turns into an Easter egg, and the rest begin to hunt him! The task of the transformed one is to survive in order to receive a reward of 250 coins. If you fail to survive, the reward will be divided between the hunters in proportion to the damage caused. You have 5 minutes to hunt. If the map changes during the event, no one will receive a reward. Easter eggs spawn in all modes except Zombie mode;

Big Easter eggs mechanics - they disappear 60 minutes after they appear, and the reward of 500 coins is divided between the players in proportion to the damage caused. The one who killed the Easter egg will receive an additional bonus: 20 grenades, 20 bumblebees, 20 mk3, 20 m202! Easter eggs spawn in all modes;

Little Easter eggs mechanics - they disappear 30 seconds after they appear, and you can knock out from 5 to 15 coins from them. Easter eggs spawn in all modes;

Easter eggs are not tied to a time frame, as it was in previous years, when Easter eggs could appear exactly at 00, 10, 20, etc. minutes of each hour. Different types of Easter eggs can appear on one server at the same time, but Easter eggs of the same type cannot appear more often than once every 5 minutes. Easter eggs cannot appear if there are less than 5 players on the server. The chances of appearance are indicated above. The time between the appearance of Easter eggs is calculated randomly;

[list]
[*] Promotions have been launched for the purchase of coins and items from some seasons and editions until January 26 (23.59.59 Moscow time);
[*] Promotions have been launched for x2 experience, which will be valid on holidays and weekends;
[/list]

Changes:
[list]
[*] The game design has been changed to a festive one. The background in the game menu and the loading screen have been updated. Snow has fallen on the servers, and pleasant music is playing in the menu. M61 grenades and command blocks have been replaced by Christmas tree toys and Gifts;
[*] The texture maps, sights, and KILLOG icons for some weapons and modules have been updated;
[*] Last time, we reported that items from the "ANTIQUE SHOP": AK-12, CZ 805 BREN, UZKON UNG-12 were available for purchase for "SHARDS" for the last time, and in the future they can only be purchased for donations. This change is canceled due to the fact that the game is undergoing a rebalance, and also, it was originally assumed that items from the "ANTIQUE SHOP" could not be purchased for other currencies;
[*] CROSSBOW has returned from rework. The mechanics of the CROSSBOW have been changed. Temporarily disabled arrow hits;
[*] Weapon models updated; CROSSBOW, ROLLING PIN, TOMAHAWK;
[*] FLAMETHROWER can now be upgraded;
[/list]

Fixes:
[list]
[*] USNC BR-55 sight fixed;
[*] Fixed bug for Private mode, which caused another player to get admin rights to the server. Testing;
[*] Fixed bug with SAWN-OFF weapon (DUPLET);
[*] Fixed animation of Minigun Z.
[/list]

Several small updates with edits and improvements are possible in the coming days.

Merry Christmas and Happy New Year everyone!

