Good day to the community of the Blockade!

We wish you a lot of good things to happen in your life in the new year! Your plans come true, and dreams become reality! We wish you all good health and happiness! May the upcoming year shine, be bright and bring a lot of positive emotions and smiles! Have a great spirit for the next 365 days.

Let's summarize the results of the past year. Despite the fact that a huge amount of work has been done this year, we still did not have time to do a lot more. Some parts of our plan, which we announced at the beginning of the year, are postponed to 2022, namely, the version of the game for mobile platforms, the tank mode and season 3. To be honest, season 3 is ready and waiting for it to be released. Considering the theme of the season, we decided to postpone it to the beginning of 2022, and launch a more suitable event for you by the New Year.

What have we managed to do this year?

The biggest change is the balance of weapons and skins. This is a huge amount of work, although so far the characteristics of some items still need to be finalized. In general, it has become much easier to play, and the difference between items is not as huge as it once was, which has a positive effect on the gameplay.

The second most important change is optimization and synchronization. To put it more simply, we fixed the out-of-sync and switched to another network protocol. This year, together with your help, we tested and refined the network part of the game, so that there would be fewer strange situations when you are killed behind a wall, and the comfort of the game as a whole increased.

In preparation for the release of the tanks mode, a lot of work has been done to optimize and refine maps, as well as servers, although some of the changes are not yet visible to players at all. Only in the future the work done in this direction will bear fruit. This year, we finally redesigned the models of machines for the classic version of the game, and also made new machines. And even if not everything will be implemented in the near future, we still hope that the mode will eventually turn out to be interesting.

Do not forget about the beginning of the completion of the Construction mode. This mode has not been updated for many years. So far, this is only the addition of new blocks and the revision of some old ones, as well as the changes resulting from this revision. We plan to add the remaining new blocks that we did not have time to add this year, as well as the implementation of functionality for advanced map construction. There are plans to finalize the privates as a whole.

Work on refining the weapons and preparing it for the implementation of the customization system continues. In this update, we have replaced the models for a large number of weapons. There's not much left. After all the weapons are ready, we will be able to properly implement the system of modules and skins for weapons. Even later, the refinement of character skins will begin.

This year, work has begun on the refinement and optimization of the interface. It's no secret that the game interface is very outdated. It needs to be thoroughly redesigned, because in 2022 there are not so many useful features and settings that must be in any modern game.

All the work done directly affects the development process of the mobile version of the game. All this is necessary in order for the players to receive a finished product for mobile platforms as a result.

Let's move on to the list of changes and innovations:

[b]Innovations:[/b]
[list]
[*] A festive New Year update has been added to the game. The update will be in the game until January 23 inclusive;
[*] All players have been given gifts, which can be found in the OTHER section of your INVENTORY. Gift contents: 50 coins, 22 M61 grenades, PREMIUM 2 days, 22 mk3 grenades, 22 M202, 22 first aid kits L, 22 mortars, 22
[*] mines. To display the gift correctly, you need to re-enter the game. If the gift is not displayed after restarting the game, we recommend that you clear the browser cache. Gifts can be picked up until January 23;
[*] "The Christmas Tree 2022" event has been launched, where each player is given the opportunity to get skins for free: TIGER, POLAR BEAR, ROBOT, hats: EARFLAPS NY, ROOF, weapons: AK47 NY, M4A1 NY, NEGEV NY, M2 NY, DAEWOO K7 NY, SIG P226 NY, HK SL8 NY, as well as a unique badge. This year's event consists of 21 stages. The event works according to the principle of seasons. Initially, only one stage is available for passing. A new stage opens every day. At the same time, the old stages are also available for completion. Every day you can complete 3 missions, for each of which 250 progress points are given. In just one day, you can earn 750 progress points for completing missions out of the required 1000. The rest can be obtained simply by playing the game. We remind you that missions will not be in progress if there are less than 5 players on the server. "The Christmas Tree 2022" can be completed until January 23;
[*] The NEW YEAR edition has been added to the game. The new edition includes: AK47, M4A1, NEGEV, SIG P226, HK SL8, BENELLI M2, DAEWOO K7. All weapons in the edition are fully upgraded. NEW YEAR Edition can be bought again next year;
[*] New character skins have been added to the game: POLAR BEAR, ROBOT, TIGER. Character skins can be obtained for passing the event "The Christmas Tree 2022". These skins will go on sale in 1 year for coins;
[*] ROBOT Skin: Gets 12% less bullet damage and 7% less cold weapon damage;
