[*] Added 4 new hats: ROOF, WARM EARS, EARFLAPS, GIFT. WARM EARS and a GIFT are available in the store for coins and will be on sale until January 23. The rest of the hats can be obtained for passing the event "The Christmas Tree 2022". Hats can be bought for coins each next year;
