In this update, we have changed the damage system. This is an open test for all players. Based on the results of the test, it will be clear whether such a system should be left in the game or not. You can find the list of changes below:

Innovations:
[list]
[*] By March 8, all players have received gifts;
[*] Added indication of damage done (can be disabled in options);
[*] Added a new damage system for all players. If these changes improve the state of things on the servers, then there is a high probability that, with improvements and balancing edits, this system can be implemented in the game on an ongoing basis:
[olist]
[*] Removed the parameter of penetrating armor from weapons;
[*] Damage from weapons first goes to the armor, and then to the body;
[*] Normal armor gives 25 protection, and reinforced 50;
[*] Helmets now reduce "additional damage" to the head. You already know that in the game, weapon damage to the head is doubled. The addition to the base damage is "additional damage";
[*] Normal helmet reduces additional damage to the head by 25%, and fortified helmet by 50;
[*] The helmet flies when killing a player in the head;
[*] Because the characteristics of the weapon remain the same, then some weapons may lose their effectiveness, and other weapons will become very powerful;
[/olist]
[*] Added the Pan weapon to the sale;
[*] Added a special offer for the purchase of coins;
[*] Until March 14, a special offer is available in the store for the purchase of a LADY edition for a donation;
[*] Until March 14 in the game, all players receive double experience on servers.
[/list]

Changes:
[list]
