Hello to the Blockade soldiers and guests of our project.

Today, [b]May 9[/b], [u]we celebrate the 74th anniversary of the Victory in the Great Patriotic War[/u]. This is a memorial day with tears in eyes.

[b]Victory Day[/b] is a holiday that fills our hearts with pride and appreciation. This is a celebration of courage, heroism and kindness. This is a holiday that gave the future to us, our children and grandchildren! We sincerely wish you good health, happiness, a peaceful sky over your head!

On this day, we would like to congratulate not only those who gave their lives in the struggle for peace, in the fight against fascism, not only those who went through the whole war and brought victory on their shoulders, not only those who worked behind the lines , worked to win. We want to congratulate everyone. All without exception. [b]This victory is common[/b], it is one for all, as one for all this fragile world, as one for all of our home - our blue planet. [b]Happy holiday to all of us! May there be peace in the whole world![/b]

Victory Day for the Blockade Classic released a festive update. In addition to adding a thematic mode and design of the game, this year the developers decided to please you with a new weapon! Each player will be given gifts in honor of the holiday. [u]Mode, design and special offers will be in the game until May 26.[/u]

List of changes, innovations and fixes:

[list]
[*] All players are given gifts. In order to pick up a gift, you must go into the game and check the tab [b]"other"[/b] in your inventory. If the gift does not appear, then [u]you need to re-enter the game;[/u]
[*] Added weapons [b]Kar98k, MG13, TT, RPD[/b]. All themed weapons can be found in a special section in the store;
